*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CLM0007
*> PURPOSE : INSURANCE CLAIMS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-03-11 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-11-09 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 137
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CLMNIGHT STEP050
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CLM0007.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY CLM0007C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==TX==.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    *> A=APPROVE I=INVESTIGATE D=DENY
    05 C-DN               PIC X VALUE 'A'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM CLAIM-ROUTING
    DISPLAY "C-DN=" C-DN
    STOP RUN.
CLAIM-ROUTING.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN TX-WS-CLAM <= 1500.00 AND TX-WS-PCLM < 2
            MOVE 'A' TO C-DN
        WHEN TX-WS-CLAM > 50000
            MOVE 'I' TO C-DN
        *> NEW POLICY CLAIM
        WHEN TX-WS-POLM < 3
            MOVE 'I' TO C-DN
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 'A' TO C-DN
    END-EVALUATE.
